---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Website as a Service (WaaS 2.0) — Redemption Analytics"
  description="The last web agency relationship you'll ever need. Custom websites, GA4 analytics, ongoing evolution — all yours to keep. No redesign fees. Ever."
>

<!-- WAAS HERO -->
<section class="wh">
  <div class="wh-inner">
    <div class="kicker wh-kicker sr">Website as a Service 2.0</div>
    <h1 class="wh-h sr d1">
      The last web relationship<br>
      <span class="serif-it">you'll ever need.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="wh-sub sr d2">Most agencies build you a website and leave. We stay — continuously evolving your digital infrastructure so you never pay a redesign fee, never lose your data, and never start from scratch.</p>
    <div class="wh-actions sr d3">
      <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary" style="font-size:.9375rem;padding:.85rem 1.875rem">
        Schedule a Consultation
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a href="#included" class="btn-ghost">See what's included ↓</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="wh-stats">
    <div class="whs-cell">
      <div class="whs-n">100<span class="whs-dim">%</span></div>
      <div class="whs-l">Code Ownership</div>
    </div>
    <div class="whs-cell">
      <div class="whs-n">$<span class="whs-dim">0</span></div>
      <div class="whs-l">Redesign Fees</div>
    </div>
    <div class="whs-cell">
      <div class="whs-n">GA<span class="whs-dim">4</span></div>
      <div class="whs-l">Native Analytics</div>
    </div>
    <div class="whs-cell">
      <div class="whs-n">∞</div>
      <div class="whs-l">Design Iterations</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHAT IS WAAS -->
<section class="what">
  <div class="what-inner">
    <div class="what-left sr">
      <div class="kicker">What is WaaS?</div>
      <h2 class="display-title" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem">The subscription model<br><span class="serif-it">done right.</span></h2>
      <p class="section-sub" style="max-width:100%;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Traditional agencies charge you a large project fee, hand you a website, and then charge again every 3–5 years when it gets stale — or every time you want a change. That's not a service. That's a billing cycle.</p>
      <p class="section-sub" style="max-width:100%;margin-bottom:2rem">WaaS 2.0 is different. One ongoing engagement that covers strategy, design, development, hosting, analytics, and optimization — continuously. You pay a flat monthly rate. We handle everything. You own everything.</p>
      <div class="what-promise">
        <div class="wp-item"><span class="wp-dot"></span><span>No project fees. No redesign invoices.</span></div>
        <div class="wp-item"><span class="wp-dot"></span><span>Senior-led from kickoff through year five.</span></div>
        <div class="wp-item"><span class="wp-dot"></span><span>100% code, domain, and data ownership.</span></div>
        <div class="wp-item"><span class="wp-dot"></span><span>Cancel anytime. Keep everything.</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="what-right sr d2">
      <div class="wcard-group">
        <div class="wcard wcard-dark">
          <div class="wcard-label">Traditional Agency Model</div>
          <div class="wcard-items">
            <div class="wcard-item bad"><span class="wi-icon">✕</span><span class="wi-text">$8,000–$30,000 upfront project fee</span></div>
            <div class="wcard-item bad"><span class="wi-icon">✕</span><span class="wi-text">$5,000+ redesign every 3–5 years</span></div>
            <div class="wcard-item bad"><span class="wi-icon">✕</span><span class="wi-text">Hourly billing for every small change</span></div>
            <div class="wcard-item bad"><span class="wi-icon">✕</span><span class="wi-text">Junior team after kickoff</span></div>
            <div class="wcard-item bad"><span class="wi-icon">✕</span><span class="wi-text">You own nothing when you leave</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="wcard wcard-blue">
          <div class="wcard-label">Redemption Analytics WaaS</div>
          <div class="wcard-items">
            <div class="wcard-item good"><span class="wi-icon">✓</span><span class="wi-text">Flat monthly rate — no surprises</span></div>
            <div class="wcard-item good"><span class="wi-icon">✓</span><span class="wi-text">Continuous evolution, $0 redesign fees</span></div>
            <div class="wcard-item good"><span class="wi-icon">✓</span><span class="wi-text">Unlimited design iterations included</span></div>
            <div class="wcard-item good"><span class="wi-icon">✓</span><span class="wi-text">Senior consultants, always</span></div>
            <div class="wcard-item good"><span class="wi-icon">✓</span><span class="wi-text">You own 100% when you leave</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- EVERYTHING INCLUDED -->
<section class="inc" id="included">
  <div class="inc-head">
    <div>
      <div class="kicker sr">What's Included</div>
      <h2 class="display-title sr d1">Everything you need.<br><span class="serif-it">Nothing you don't.</span></h2>
    </div>
    <p class="section-sub sr d2">Every WaaS engagement includes the full stack — design, development, infrastructure, and strategy. There are no add-on fees for things that should be standard.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="inc-grid sr">
    <!-- Row 1 -->
    <div class="ic ic-lg blue">
      <div class="ic-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18M9 21V9"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="ic-num">01</div>
      <div class="ic-title">Custom Website Build</div>
      <p class="ic-body">Bespoke design and development using Next.js or Astro — chosen based on your specific performance and feature requirements. Zero templates sold to your competitors.</p>
      <span class="ic-tag">Next.js · Astro</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ic">
      <div class="ic-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="ic-num">02</div>
      <div class="ic-title">SEO Foundation &amp; Growth</div>
      <p class="ic-body">Technical SEO, local search dominance, and ongoing content strategy. We build the foundation and keep building it.</p>
      <span class="ic-tag">Technical SEO</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ic">
      <div class="ic-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="ic-num">03</div>
      <div class="ic-title">GA4 Analytics Setup</div>
      <p class="ic-body">Full Google Analytics 4 configuration, custom event tracking, and monthly reporting. Your data stays yours — forever.</p>
      <span class="ic-tag">GA4 Native</span>
    </div>
    <!-- Row 2 -->
    <div class="ic">
      <div class="ic-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="ic-num">04</div>
      <div class="ic-title">Hosting Infrastructure</div>
      <p class="ic-body">Enterprise-grade deployment on Vercel or Cloudflare with 99.99% uptime SLA, global CDN, and automatic scaling.</p>
      <span class="ic-tag">Vercel · Cloudflare</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ic">
      <div class="ic-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 20h9M16.5 3.5a2.121 2.121 0 013 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4L16.5 3.5z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="ic-num">05</div>
      <div class="ic-title">Ongoing Design Evolution</div>
      <p class="ic-body">As design trends shift and your brand grows, we update continuously. No redesign fees. No scope change invoices. It's included.</p>
      <span class="ic-tag">Unlimited Iterations</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ic">
      <div class="ic-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0110 0v4"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="ic-num">06</div>
      <div class="ic-title">Security &amp; Compliance</div>
      <p class="ic-body">HIPAA-compliant infrastructure for medical clients, attorney-client privilege considerations for legal firms, and ADA compliance across the board.</p>
      <span class="ic-tag">HIPAA · ADA</span>
    </div>
    <!-- Row 3 -->
    <div class="ic">
      <div class="ic-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 8v4l3 3"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="ic-num">07</div>
      <div class="ic-title">Monthly Strategy Sessions</div>
      <p class="ic-body">Regular check-ins with your senior consultant to review performance data, prioritize updates, and refine your digital strategy.</p>
      <span class="ic-tag">Senior-Led</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ic">
      <div class="ic-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="ic-num">08</div>
      <div class="ic-title">Content Management</div>
      <p class="ic-body">We handle copy updates, page additions, and content refreshes on your behalf — or set you up with a headless CMS so you can self-manage.</p>
      <span class="ic-tag">Headless CMS</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ic ic-lg dark">
      <div class="ic-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 01-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 01-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 01-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 01-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 014.11 2h3a2 2 0 012 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 01-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 006 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 012.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0122 16.92z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="ic-num">09</div>
      <div class="ic-title">Priority Support</div>
      <p class="ic-body">Direct access to your team. Critical issues resolved within hours, not days. No ticket queue, no chatbot. A real conversation with the person who built your site.</p>
      <span class="ic-tag">Direct Access</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- OWNERSHIP PROMISE -->
<section class="own">
  <div class="own-inner">
    <div class="own-left sr">
      <div class="kicker own-kicker">The Ownership Promise</div>
      <h2 class="own-h">When you sign with us,<br>you get a legally-documented<br><span class="serif-it">ownership guarantee.</span></h2>
      <p class="own-body">We don't believe in holding clients hostage. Every engagement comes with explicit documentation of what you own — and it's everything. If we part ways, you walk out with your entire digital estate intact.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="own-right sr d2">
      <div class="own-items">
        <div class="own-item">
          <div class="own-item-num">01</div>
          <div class="own-item-content">
            <div class="own-item-title">Source Code Repository</div>
            <p class="own-item-body">Your complete codebase, version history, and all deployment configuration. Hosted on your own GitHub organization — always.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="own-item">
          <div class="own-item-num">02</div>
          <div class="own-item-content">
            <div class="own-item-title">Domain &amp; DNS Records</div>
            <p class="own-item-body">Your domain is registered and controlled by you. We never hold domain registrar credentials. Switching hosts takes hours, not months.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="own-item">
          <div class="own-item-num">03</div>
          <div class="own-item-content">
            <div class="own-item-title">Analytics Data &amp; History</div>
            <p class="own-item-body">GA4 is connected to your Google account. Years of behavioral data, conversion history, and audience insights stay with you — unconditionally.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="own-item">
          <div class="own-item-num">04</div>
          <div class="own-item-content">
            <div class="own-item-title">Bespoke Design System</div>
            <p class="own-item-body">Your visual identity, component library, and design files are yours exclusively. We never sell or reuse design work across clients.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="own-item">
          <div class="own-item-num">05</div>
          <div class="own-item-content">
            <div class="own-item-title">All Content &amp; Copy</div>
            <p class="own-item-body">Every word, image, and document on your site is your intellectual property. Full stop.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- TECH STACK -->
<section class="tech">
  <div class="tech-head sr">
    <div class="kicker tech-kicker">Technology</div>
    <h2 class="display-title" style="color:white;margin-bottom:1rem">We choose tools that<br><span class="serif-it">serve your business.</span></h2>
    <p class="section-sub" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.4);max-width:520px">Not the tools that create the most lock-in. Every technology decision is made in your interest, and you can migrate to any other stack at any time.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="tech-grid sr d1">
    <div class="tc">
      <div class="tc-logo">Next</div>
      <div class="tc-name">Next.js</div>
      <p class="tc-body">React-based framework for sites that need server-side logic, client portals, intake forms, or real-time features. Best-in-class developer ecosystem.</p>
      <div class="tc-use">Best for: Law firm intranets, patient portals, financial dashboards</div>
    </div>
    <div class="tc">
      <div class="tc-logo">Astro</div>
      <div class="tc-name">Astro</div>
      <p class="tc-body">Zero-JavaScript-by-default static site generator. Delivers perfect Lighthouse scores out of the box. Ideal for content-first marketing sites that need to rank.</p>
      <div class="tc-use">Best for: Law firm marketing sites, medical practice pages, landing pages</div>
    </div>
    <div class="tc">
      <div class="tc-logo">GA4</div>
      <div class="tc-name">Google Analytics 4</div>
      <p class="tc-body">The gold standard in web analytics. Behavioral data, conversion funnels, audience insights — all owned by you, never by us. No proprietary lock-in.</p>
      <div class="tc-use">Best for: Every client, every engagement</div>
    </div>
    <div class="tc">
      <div class="tc-logo">▲</div>
      <div class="tc-name">Vercel / Cloudflare</div>
      <p class="tc-body">Enterprise-grade edge deployment with a global CDN. Your site loads fast in Pittsburgh, fast in LA, fast for every potential client everywhere.</p>
      <div class="tc-use">99.99% uptime SLA · Global edge network</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHO IT'S FOR -->
<section class="for">
  <div class="for-head">
    <div>
      <div class="kicker sr">Who WaaS Is For</div>
      <h2 class="display-title sr d1">Built for firms that<br><span class="serif-it">can't afford to compromise.</span></h2>
    </div>
    <p class="section-sub sr d2">WaaS 2.0 is designed for professional services practices where credibility is everything — and where a slow, generic, or compromised web presence costs real clients.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="for-grid sr">
    <div class="fc">
      <div class="fc-n">§</div>
      <div class="fc-title">Law Firms</div>
      <p class="fc-body">Dominate local search for your practice areas without paying per-lead middlemen. Own your intake pipeline from first Google search through signed retainer.</p>
      <ul class="fc-list">
        <li>Attorney marketing & local SEO</li>
        <li>Intake form optimization</li>
        <li>Client portal infrastructure</li>
        <li>Attorney-client privilege compliance</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="fc">
      <div class="fc-n">Rx</div>
      <div class="fc-title">Medical Practices</div>
      <p class="fc-body">HIPAA-compliant infrastructure that connects patients to care — fast, secure, and built to convert before your competition even loads.</p>
      <ul class="fc-list">
        <li>HIPAA-compliant patient forms</li>
        <li>Provider directory & scheduling</li>
        <li>Insurance & location pages</li>
        <li>ADA accessibility compliance</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="fc">
      <div class="fc-n">$</div>
      <div class="fc-title">Financial Advisors</div>
      <p class="fc-body">Fiduciary-grade web performance. No conflicts of interest baked into your tech stack. Compliance-aware from day one.</p>
      <ul class="fc-list">
        <li>SEC/FINRA-aware content strategy</li>
        <li>Advisor bio & credential pages</li>
        <li>Client login portal</li>
        <li>Disclosure & compliance pages</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="fc">
      <div class="fc-n">+</div>
      <div class="fc-title">Other Professional Services</div>
      <p class="fc-body">Real estate, insurance, accounting, non-profit — if your clients trust you with important decisions, we can build the infrastructure that earns that trust online.</p>
      <ul class="fc-list">
        <li>Property showcase & MLS integration</li>
        <li>Non-profit donation infrastructure</li>
        <li>ADA compliance & audit readiness</li>
        <li>Government accessibility standards</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PROCESS -->
<section class="proc" id="process">
  <div class="proc-header">
    <div>
      <div class="kicker sr">WaaS Onboarding</div>
      <h2 class="display-title sr d1">Live in <span class="serif-it">30 days.</span></h2>
    </div>
    <p class="section-sub sr d2">Our onboarding is designed to get you from first conversation to live website in 30 days — without sacrificing quality or cutting corners on strategy.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="proc-steps">
    <div class="ps sr">
      <div class="ps-n">01</div>
      <div class="ps-title">Discovery Call</div>
      <p class="ps-body">60 minutes with your senior consultant. We map your current situation, your goals, your competitors, and what success looks like in 90 days.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ps sr d1">
      <div class="ps-n">02</div>
      <div class="ps-title">Strategy &amp; Design</div>
      <p class="ps-body">We present a custom strategy and initial design direction within 5 business days. You approve before a single line of code is written.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ps sr d2">
      <div class="ps-n">03</div>
      <div class="ps-title">Build &amp; Launch</div>
      <p class="ps-body">Development with weekly progress updates and two rounds of revisions. QA testing across devices. Launch when you're satisfied — not on our timeline.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ps sr d3">
      <div class="ps-n">04</div>
      <div class="ps-title">Ongoing Partnership</div>
      <p class="ps-body">Monthly strategy sessions, continuous design evolution, priority support, and performance reporting. Your site grows as you grow.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="faq">
  <div class="faq-head">
    <div class="kicker sr">Common Questions</div>
    <h2 class="display-title sr d1">Straight <span class="serif-it">answers.</span></h2>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-list sr d1">
    <details class="fq">
      <summary class="fq-q">What does "ownership" actually mean in practice?</summary>
      <div class="fq-a">
        <p>It means you have full, unconditional access to everything we build. Your code lives in a GitHub repository registered to your organization — not ours. Your domain is registered to you. Your GA4 property is connected to your Google account. We document all of this in writing at the start of every engagement. If you cancel tomorrow, you walk away with a complete, deployable website and all your historical data.</p>
      </div>
    </details>
    <details class="fq">
      <summary class="fq-q">What happens if I cancel my WaaS subscription?</summary>
      <div class="fq-a">
        <p>You keep everything. Your website continues to run on whatever hosting you choose. Your GA4 analytics history remains in your account. Your design files and codebase are yours. The only thing that changes is that you'll need to handle ongoing updates yourself or engage another provider. There are no exit fees, no data holds, and no "proprietary system" keeping you locked in.</p>
      </div>
    </details>
    <details class="fq">
      <summary class="fq-q">How does "ongoing evolution" work? What's actually included?</summary>
      <div class="fq-a">
        <p>Ongoing evolution means we treat your website as a living product, not a completed project. This includes design refreshes as trends evolve, new page additions as your services expand, copy updates as your messaging sharpens, performance optimizations as new tooling emerges, and technology upgrades before your stack becomes outdated. This is included in your monthly rate — not billed separately as a project or by the hour.</p>
      </div>
    </details>
    <details class="fq">
      <summary class="fq-q">How is this different from a traditional monthly retainer?</summary>
      <div class="fq-a">
        <p>Traditional retainers bill hourly or by task, creating an incentive for agencies to slow down work and bill more. WaaS is a flat monthly rate that covers everything — strategy, design, development, hosting, support, and reporting. We're incentivized to work efficiently and make you successful, because our model depends on you staying satisfied with results.</p>
      </div>
    </details>
    <details class="fq">
      <summary class="fq-q">Can you migrate my existing website?</summary>
      <div class="fq-a">
        <p>Yes. We handle migrations from legacy WordPress installations, Squarespace, Wix, and custom-built sites. We'll audit your current site, preserve your existing SEO equity and analytics history where possible, and rebuild on a modern stack that actually performs. Migration is included in your onboarding — no additional fee.</p>
      </div>
    </details>
    <details class="fq">
      <summary class="fq-q">What are the contract terms?</summary>
      <div class="fq-a">
        <p>WaaS engagements are billed monthly with no long-term lock-in. We offer a 30-day satisfaction guarantee on all new engagements — if you're not satisfied after the first month, we'll refund your subscription. Most clients stay for years because the model works, not because they're contractually obligated to.</p>
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="cta-section">
  <div class="cta-kicker">Ready to own your digital presence?</div>
  <h2 class="cta-h sr">Stop renting.<br><span class="serif-it">Start owning.</span></h2>
  <div class="cta-actions sr d1">
    <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary" style="font-size:.9375rem;padding:.8rem 1.75rem">
      Schedule a Consultation
      <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
    </a>
    <a href="/#vicall" class="btn-ghost">Learn about ViCall</a>
  </div>
  <p class="cta-contact sr d2">
    Or reach us directly:
    <a href="mailto:Reece@redemptionanalytics.com">Reece@redemptionanalytics.com</a>
    &ensp;·&ensp;
    <a href="tel:+14128628887">412-862-8887</a>
  </p>
</section>

<!-- CONTACT -->
<section class="contact" id="contact">
  <div>
    <div class="kicker sr">Get Started</div>
    <h2 class="ct-title sr d1">Tell us about<br>your <span class="serif-it">practice.</span></h2>
